{"id":"n17290-6-1","stage":3,"title":"가리다 · 自食其力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17290-6-1-1","ko":"자기 앞도 못 가리는 사람하고 어떻게 결혼을 하니?","zh":"怎么能嫁给一个连自己都照顾不好的人？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자기","meaning":"你","explanation":"자기：你","readings":[{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57310","senseId":"2","lemma":"자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞도","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가리는","meaning":"自食其力，自顾","explanation":"가리다：自食其力，自顾；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가리다","audio":"/audio/2015aa077867f9c06e04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17290","senseId":"6","lemma":"가리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람하고","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；하고：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼을","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、